[sliver] The disposal warning has integral raised letters with 6.5 mm H capitals. These narrow faces are the letter strokes and the sides of their 0.6 mm outward projection. Every glyph is fused into the continuous rear wall behind the smooth field. The accepted STL is one watertight body, and its production-profile slice adds no support contacts beneath the lettering.
